ry. Also, the out of vocabulary words, generally the spelling mistakes done by the author, depict the style of the writing text, and therefore, comes to be an important aspect of the solution. The solution, thus, comes to be finding the total probability of each Ngram to be written by the particular author in the email.","topics":[],"score":2594,"global_rank":41676,"python_rank":7831},{"name":"infrared0/ccm-rural-repair","owner":"infrared0","html_url":"https://github.com/infrared0/ccm-rural-repair","stars":2,"forks":1,"watchers":4,"issues":1,"language":"Python","description":"Additions to the Community Cellular Manager (CCM) stack that facilitate community management and maintenance.","topics":[],"score":2594,"global_rank":41696,"python_rank":7832},{"name":"jjon/DT2enex","owner":"jjon","html_url":"https://github.com/jjon/DT2enex","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"rudimentary python script to generate enex file from DevonThink 'html' export","topics":[],"score":2594,"global_rank":41700,"python_rank":7833},{"name":"lantzbuilds/formava_ai_trainer","owner":"lantzbuilds","html_url":"https://github.com/lantzbuilds/formava_ai_trainer","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":52,"language":"Python","description":"An app that combines the power of OpenAI's LLMs with Hevy's public API to ingest and generate exercise routines.","topics":[],"score":2594,"global_rank":41702,"python_rank":7834},{"name":"asmoly/Person_Detection","owner":"asmoly","html_url":"https://github.com/asmoly/Person_Detection","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"This is a convolutional neural network which I created. It can find people in a video. I used this network for a school project in which I tracked the number of people in a room over 48 hours.","topics":[],"score":2594,"global_rank":41708,"python_rank":7835},{"name":"0xjeffro/DexscreenerChainsMonitor","owner":"0xjeffro","html_url":"https://github.com/0xjeffro/De